Synthetic scorer self-test case: package-imports-alias

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S3, S6

Scenario
A new root package.json maps "imports": {"#orders-store": "./src/orders/repository.ts"}. src/payments/service.ts imports { updateOrderStatus } from "#orders-store".

Expected
One CRITICAL_DIRECT runtime finding plus ALIAS_CONFIG_TOUCHED. S3 resolves through package.json "imports".

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
